dingView? These 3 free ones, combined into one trading strategy","sourceAuthor":"Technical Trading (Instagram reel, Patreon TechnicalTradingTV)","publishedOn":"2026-11-14","claimedMethod":"SuperTrend, Ultimate MA and AlphaTrend combined, Slingshot filter, Chandelier Exit; trades on the 1-minute chart with signals from a higher timeframe (5-minute shown). 1 NQ contract, fees included, no slippage. The exact rules and the test report are sold on Patreon; Vertex did not buy or copy them.","claimedMetrics":[{"label":"Instrument","value":"NQ futures, 1 contract"},{"label":"Years","value":"profitable in each of the last 16 years"},{"label":"Last 12 months","value":"over $100,000 after fees"},{"label":"Slippage","value":"none"}]}'::jsonb)
